@host = http://localhost:3001
@idEspacio = 1
@idReservacion = 1
# Copy the UUID from the admin QR's url; do not paste a personal credential QR.
@tokenCubiculo = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### With an admin/superadmin session: view/download the permanent cubicle QR
GET {{host}}/api/espacios/{{idEspacio}}/qr

### All authenticated users can read the current window
GET {{host}}/api/check-in/configuracion

### Admin only: persist both values (integers 0..180)
PUT {{host}}/api/check-in/configuracion
Content-Type: application/json

{"minutos_antes":15,"minutos_despues":20}

### With the reservation owner's session: opening the QR has no side effects
GET {{host}}/api/check-in/{{tokenCubiculo}}

### Confirm: 200 with activa and check_in_en; retry returns 409
POST {{host}}/api/check-in/{{tokenCubiculo}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id_reservacion":{{idReservacion}}}
